{
  "name": "Sanaku - W2b Reply Handler",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## W2b - Inbound reply handler\n\nWatches the Gmail inbox. When a prospect replies:\n1. Classifies the reply via OpenRouter: positive / question / not_now / opt_out\n2. Logs it to `sanaku_conversations` with a sentiment tag\n3. **opt_out -> `do_not_contact = true`, `status = 'dnc'`, immediately and permanently. No exceptions, no re-entry.**\n4. positive / question -> `status = 'replied'` + an alert email to me with the reply and the booking link\n\nCredentials: \"Gmail Account\", \"OpenRouter (Header Auth)\", \"Supabase Service Role (Header Auth)\".\nEnv: SUPABASE_URL, SANAKU_OWNER_EMAIL, SANAKU_BOOKING_URL, optional OPENROUTER_MODEL.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 540
      },
      "id": "f3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000099",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [40, 20]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [ { "mode": "everyMinute" } ]
        },
        "simple": true,
        "filters": {},
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Gmail Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmailTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [120, 500],
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": { "id": "gmail-oauth2", "name": "Gmail Account" }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "// Pull the sender address + reply text out of whichever shape the trigger emits.\nconst m = $input.first().json || {};\nconst fromRaw = m.From || m.from || (m.headers && m.headers.from) ||\n  (m.from && m.from.value && m.from.value[0] && m.from.value[0].address) || '';\nconst match = String(typeof fromRaw === 'object' ? JSON.stringify(fromRaw) : fromRaw).match(/[\\w.+-]+@[\\w-]+\\.[\\w.]+/);\nconst fromEmail = match ? match[0].toLowerCase() : null;\nconst body = String(m.snippet || m.textPlain || m.text || '').slice(0, 2000);\nconst subject = String(m.Subject || m.subject || '');\nif (!fromEmail) return [];\nreturn [{ json: { from_email: fromEmail, reply_body: body, reply_subject: subject } }];"
      },
      "id": "f3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Extract Sender",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [340, 500]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $env.SUPABASE_URL }}/rest/v1/sanaku_prospects?contact_email=ilike.{{ $json.from_email }}&select=id,company_name,vertical,contact_name,status&limit=1",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": { "timeout": 15000 }
      },
      "id": "f3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Get Prospect",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [560, 500],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": { "id": "supabase-header-auth", "name": "Supabase Service Role (Header Auth)" }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "loose", "version": 2 },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "found",
              "leftValue": "={{ !!$json.id }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": { "type": "boolean", "operation": "true", "singleValue": true }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Prospect Found?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [780, 500]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "f3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Not A Prospect",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1000, 680]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://openrouter.ai/api/v1/chat/completions",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ model: $env.OPENROUTER_MODEL || 'meta-llama/llama-3.3-70b-instruct:free', messages: [ { role: 'system', content: 'Classify a reply to a cold B2B email. Respond with exactly one word from: positive, question, not_now, opt_out. \\'positive\\' = interested, wants to talk, gives useful info about their problem. \\'question\\' = asks who we are / what this is. \\'not_now\\' = polite decline or bad timing. \\'opt_out\\' = any variant of stop, unsubscribe, no thanks, remove me, not interested at all. When in doubt between not_now and opt_out, choose opt_out.' }, { role: 'user', content: $('Extract Sender').first().json.reply_body } ], max_tokens: 5, temperature: 0 }) }}",
        "options": { "timeout": 45000 }
      },
      "id": "f3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Classify Reply",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1000, 420],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": { "id": "openrouter-header-auth", "name": "OpenRouter (Header Auth)" }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "// Normalize the classification; fail safe toward opt_out on explicit stop words.\nconst prospect = $('Get Prospect').first().json;\nconst reply = $('Extract Sender').first().json;\nconst resp = $input.first().json || {};\nlet cls = '';\ntry { cls = String(resp.choices[0].message.content || '').toLowerCase().trim(); } catch (e) { cls = ''; }\nif (!['positive', 'question', 'not_now', 'opt_out'].includes(cls)) {\n  // LLM failed - keyword safety net, biased toward opt_out\n  cls = /stop|unsubscribe|remove me|no thanks|not interested|don.?t (contact|email)/i.test(reply.reply_body) ? 'opt_out' : 'question';\n}\nconst sentimentMap = { positive: 'positive', question: 'neutral', not_now: 'negative', opt_out: 'opt_out' };\nreturn [{ json: {\n  prospect_id: prospect.id,\n  company_name: prospect.company_name,\n  contact_name: prospect.contact_name,\n  from_email: reply.from_email,\n  reply_body: reply.reply_body,\n  classification: cls,\n  sentiment: sentimentMap[cls],\n} }];"
      },
      "id": "f3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "name": "Parse Classification",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1220, 420]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.SUPABASE_URL }}/rest/v1/sanaku_conversations",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "Prefer", "value": "return=minimal" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ prospect_id: $json.prospect_id, channel: 'email', direction: 'inbound', body: $json.reply_body, sentiment: $json.sentiment }) }}",
        "options": { "timeout": 15000 }
      },
      "id": "f3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000008",
      "name": "Log Inbound",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1440, 420],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": { "id": "supabase-header-auth", "name": "Supabase Service Role (Header Auth)" }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "loose", "version": 2 },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "optout",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Parse Classification').first().json.classification === 'opt_out' }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": { "type": "boolean", "operation": "true", "singleValue": true }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000009",
      "name": "Opt Out?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [1660, 420]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "url": "={{ $env.SUPABASE_URL }}/rest/v1/sanaku_prospects?id=eq.{{ $('Parse Classification').first().json.prospect_id }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "Prefer", "value": "return=minimal" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ do_not_contact: true, status: 'dnc' }) }}",
        "options": { "timeout": 15000 }
      },
      "id": "f3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000010",
      "name": "Set DNC",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1880, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": { "id": "supabase-header-auth", "name": "Supabase Service Role (Header Auth)" }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "url": "={{ $env.SUPABASE_URL }}/rest/v1/sanaku_prospects?id=eq.{{ $('Parse Classification').first().json.prospect_id }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "Prefer", "value": "return=minimal" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ status: 'replied' }) }}",
        "options": { "timeout": 15000 }
      },
      "id": "f3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000011",
      "name": "Set Replied",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1880, 540],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": { "id": "supabase-header-auth", "name": "Supabase Service Role (Header Auth)" }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "loose", "version": 2 },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "notify",
              "leftValue": "={{ ['positive', 'question'].includes($('Parse Classification').first().json.classification) }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": { "type": "boolean", "operation": "true", "singleValue": true }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000012",
      "name": "Worth An Alert?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [2100, 540]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $env.SANAKU_OWNER_EMAIL }}",
        "subject": "=[reply: {{ $('Parse Classification').first().json.classification }}] {{ $('Parse Classification').first().json.company_name }}",
        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "=<h3>{{ $('Parse Classification').first().json.company_name }} replied</h3><p><b>From:</b> {{ $('Parse Classification').first().json.contact_name }} ({{ $('Parse Classification').first().json.from_email }})</p><blockquote>{{ $('Parse Classification').first().json.reply_body }}</blockquote><p>Reply from your own inbox, or send them the booking link: {{ $env.SANAKU_BOOKING_URL }}</p>",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000013",
      "name": "Alert Me",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [2320, 420],
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": { "id": "gmail-oauth2", "name": "Gmail Account" }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "f3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000014",
      "name": "Done",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [2320, 660]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Gmail Trigger": {
      "main": [ [ { "node": "Extract Sender", "type": "main", "index": 0 } ] ]
    },
    "Extract Sender": {
      "main": [ [ { "node": "Get Prospect", "type": "main", "index": 0 } ] ]
    },
    "Get Prospect": {
